      "text_4": "The image shows a modern building with a unique architectural design. The building is located on a street corner with a grassy area in front of it. The sky is blue and the sun is setting, casting a warm glow on the building.\n\nIn front of the building, there is a sidewalk with a metal railing and a bench. There are trees and bushes surrounding the sidewalk. A person is walking on the sidewalk, and there are cars parked on the street in the background. The image is taken from a low angle, looking up at the building and the street. The overall mood of the image is peaceful and serene.",
      "text_5": "The image shows a modern building with a large glass facade. The building is located on a street with a grassy area in front of it. The street is lined with trees and shrubs, and there are a few people walking on the sidewalk. The sky is blue and the sun is setting, casting a warm glow on the building. The reflection of the building can be seen on the glass facade, creating a beautiful and serene atmosphere. The overall mood of the image is peaceful and inviting.",
      "text_6": "The image shows a modern building with a large glass facade. The building is located on a street with a grassy area in front of it. The street is lined with trees and shrubs, and there are a few people walking on the sidewalk. The sky is dark, and the building is lit up with bright lights. The overall atmosphere of the image is peaceful and inviting.",
      "text_7": "The image shows a modern building with a curved roof and large windows. The building is located on a street corner with a grassy area in front of it. There are three people walking on the sidewalk near the building, one of them is wearing a yellow jacket and the other two are wearing black jackets. The street is lined with trees and there is a street lamp on the right side of the image. The sky is dark and the lighting is dim, creating a peaceful and serene atmosphere.",
